# None of this is needed to build the Flutter *web* app — it's all for the
# ESP32 pillbox firmware/Wokwi simulation side of the project, which stays
# completely separate from this deployment. Skipping it just makes Vercel's
# upload/build faster; nothing here affects Wokwi, which never touches
# Vercel at all.
